<title>USA: United Cos files $500 mln debt, stock shelf.</title>
<headline>United Cos files $500 mln debt, stock shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Cos Financial Corp Wednesday filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $500 million in debt securities and common and preferred stock.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the filing said.</p>
<p>United Cos, based in Baton Rouge, La., is a financial services holding company engaged in consumer lending.</p>
